## ------------------------------
##  Secrets — never commit
## ------------------------------
## User Secrets live outside the repo (per-user), but ignore any local copies.
secrets.json
appsettings.*.local.json
*.secrets.json
*.env
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

## NOTE: appsettings.Development.json IS committed on purpose — it only holds
## the local-dev connection strings (localhost SQL + local Ollama endpoint),
## no passwords. The Aspire "sql-password" parameter is stored in User Secrets,
## not in source, so nothing sensitive is checked in.

